Mount the workbench once.

/vscode was a second mount of the same router, kept from when Coder v1's plugin
system owned the root. That system was for internal use and has been removed,
so the duplicate is a second URL for every page - a second origin for cookies
and service workers to be scoped to, and a second set of content-stamped asset
URLs to cache - with nothing behind it.

